    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940090/extras/aa9f2f0a72b191afc0cd1279ac070e39.avif?t=1745022717\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Detective Guy and his trusty sidekick Cleo the clue-sniffing dog as they investigate the mysterious death of a fabulously wealthy game designer in rural Vermont. As you explore the castle grounds, search for clues, and interview suspects, can you solve the case and bring the guilty party to justice? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play this exciting murder mystery game and test your sleuthing skills as you work to unravel the mystery and catch the killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whodunit murder mystery gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a detective and dog crime-solving team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the castle grounds and search for clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interview suspects and make deductions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve the case and apprehend the guilty party</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1940090/extras/aa9f2f0a72b191afc0cd1279ac070e39.avif?t=1745022717\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Detective Guy and his trusty sidekick Cleo the clue-sniffing dog as they investigate the mysterious death of a fabulously wealthy game designer in rural Vermont. As you explore the castle grounds, search for clues, and interview suspects, can you solve the case and bring the guilty party to justice? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play this exciting murder mystery game and test your sleuthing skills as you work to unravel the mystery and catch the killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whodunit murder mystery gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a detective and dog crime-solving team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the castle grounds and search for clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interview suspects and make deductions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve the case and apprehend the guilty party</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Join the investigation in Murder Is Game Over, a pixel art point-and-click game where you and Cleo try to solve the murder of a famous game designer. Can you uncover the clues and catch the killer before it's game over?",
    "supported_languages": "English, German, French, Russian, Simplified Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cMurder is Game Over is a delightful surprise in the vast sea of contemporary games. It masterfully blends two worlds, offering an experience that feels both nostalgic and fresh.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Gaming Corners<br><br>\u201cA game that cosily leads you through the mystery as opposed to getting your grey cells pulsating, Murder is Game Over is a fun and light-hearted way to spend an evening.\u201d<br>7.5/10 \u2013 Games Freezer<br><br>\u201cI am delighted to suggest this game to aficionados of the genre because it is extremely cheaply priced for the experience it provides.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 Hardcore Gamers Unified<br>",
